" end="02:04.693"><span begin="02:03.015" end="02:03.296">I </span><span begin="02:03.296" end="02:03.654">already </span><span begin="02:03.654" end="02:03.998">felt </span><span begin="02:03.998" end="02:04.693">love</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.955" end="02:07.641"><span begin="02:05.955" end="02:06.165">And </span><span begin="02:06.165" end="02:06.375">I </span><span begin="02:06.375" end="02:06.594">let </span><span begin="02:06.594" end="02:06.884">it </span><span begin="02:06.884" end="02:07.086">end </span><span begin="02:07.086" end="02:07.641">up</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.514" end="02:11.277"><span begin="02:08.514" end="02:08.727">End </span><span begin="02:08.727" end="02:09.011">up </span><span begin="02:09.011" end="02:09.482">dying </span><span begin="02:09.482" end="02:10.022">by </span><span begin="02:10.022" end="02:11.277">itself</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.849" end="02:14.039"><span begin="02:11.849" end="02:12.055">And </span><span begin="02:12.055" end="02:12.253">when </span><span begin="02:12.253" end="02:12.465">it's </span><span begin="02:12.465" end="02:12.695">said </span><span begin="02:12.695" end="02:12.953">and </span><span begin="02:12.953" end="02:14.039">done</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.910" end="02:16.837"><span begin="02:14.910" end="02:15.135">You </span><span begin="02:15.135" end="02:15.359">were </span><span begin="02:15.359" end="02:15.944">better </span><span begin="02:15.944" end="02:16.837">off</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.972" end="02:19.814"><span begin="02:17.972" end="02:18.210">You </span><span begin="02:18.210" end="02:18.637">deserve </span><span begin="02:18.637" end="02:19.018">real </span><span begin="02:19.018" end="02:19.814">love</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.356" end="02:25.662"><span begin="02:20.356" end="02:20.582">And </span><span begin="02:20.582" end="02:20.799">I </span><span begin="02:20.799" end="02:21.241">deserve </span><