 end="02:44.908">Now </span><span begin="02:44.908" end="02:45.553">every </span><span begin="02:45.553" end="02:45.984">girl </span><span begin="02:45.984" end="02:46.247">I </span><span begin="02:46.247" end="02:47.012">touch</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:47.265" end="02:48.859"><span begin="02:47.265" end="02:47.480">They </span><span begin="02:47.480" end="02:47.710">all </span><span begin="02:47.710" end="02:47.909">feel </span><span begin="02:47.909" end="02:48.084">the </span><span begin="02:48.084" end="02:48.859">same</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:52.731" end="02:54.803"><span begin="02:52.731" end="02:53.051">Adjust </span><span begin="02:53.051" end="02:53.354">to </span><span begin="02:53.354" end="02:53.751">the </span><span begin="02:53.751" end="02:54.803">fame</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:58.487" end="03:02.160"><span begin="02:58.487" end="02:58.732">Cause </span><span begin="02:58.732" end="02:58.993">no </span><span begin="02:58.993" end="02:59.342">one </span><span begin="02:59.342" end="02:59.738">will </span><span begin="02:59.738" end="03:00.345">love </span><span begin="03:00.345" end="03:01.271">you </span><span begin="03:01.271" end="03:01.774">like </span><span begin="03:01.774" end="03:02.160">her</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:02.634" end="03:04.038"><span begin="03:02.634" end="03:02.865">It's </span><span begin="03:02.865" end="03:04.038">pointless</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:04.531" end="03:06.842"><span begin="03:04.531" end="03:04.775">Like </span><span begin="03:04.775" end="03:05.097">tears </span><span begin="03:05.097" end="03:05.346">in </span><span begin="03:05.346" end="03:05.734">the </span><span begin="03:05.734" end="03:06.842">rain</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:07.758" end="03:09.534"><span begin="03:07.758" end="03:08.139">Like </span><span begin="03:08.139" end="03:08.400">tears </span><span begin="03:08.400" end="03:08.710">in </span><span begin="03:08.710" end="03:08.9